    "4lower": "4A: lower lobe in Yamaha printed chart (above hole in mouthpiece-up view).",
    "4upper": "4B: upper lobe in Yamaha printed chart (below hole in mouthpiece-up view).",
    "8h": "Rear thumb hole fully covered.",
    "8vent": "Rear thumb hole covered 3/4; octave key released.",
    "8key": "Rear octave lever pressed while hole is covered."
